"html": "\n<section class=\"section service-quote\" id=\"service-quote\"><div class=\"shell service-reading\"><h2>Electrical fault-finding and power repair costs</h2><div class=\"price-guide\" aria-labelledby=\"ellis-price-guide\">\n            <div class=\"shell\">\n              <div class=\"price-guide__intro\">\n                <p class=\"price-guide__kicker\">Ellis Price Guide</p>\n                <h2 id=\"ellis-price-guide\">Power-fault price guide</h2>\n                <p>\n                  A practical guide for standard fault diagnosis or priority\n                  attendance at a Perth property.\n                </p>\n              </div>\n              <div class=\"price-guide__grid\">\n                <article class=\"price-guide__item\">\n                  <h3>Power-fault diagnosis / priority attendance</h3>\n                  <p class=\"price-guide__range\">AUD $220–$440</p>\n                  <p class=\"price-guide__unit\">per attendance · incl. GST</p>\n                </article>\n              </div>\n              <p class=\"price-guide__notice\">\n                <strong>Guide conditions:</strong> These AUD ranges are for\n                standard-hours, standard-scope work and are incl. GST. Access,\n                materials, extra pipe, cable or circuit work, compliance work,\n                emergency or after-hours work and unforeseen repairs are\n                confirmed in a written quote before work proceeds.\n              </p>\n            </div>\n          </div><h3>Written quote and agreed scope</h3><p>The area losing power, recurring symptoms, accessible equipment and the findings of the on-site investigation determine the work. Finding the fault and completing a repair can involve different tasks. We explain the identified scope, replacement components and any additional circuit work before the quote is agreed.</p><p>The final written quote sets out the work included, materials and any agreed additional tasks. We explain changes to the scope before extra work proceeds. <a href=\"contact.html?service=power-faults-perth.html\">Request a electrical fault finding quote</a>.</p></div></section>" as TrustedHtml
},
{
"id": "service-faq",
"kind": "faq",
"container": "\n<section class=\"section faq service-editorial-faq\" id=\"service-faq\"><div class=\"shell service-reading\"><h2>Electrical Fault Finding &amp; Power Repairs service guidance</h2><!-- site-intent:start --><div class=\"intent-content\" data-site-intent><h3>An intermittent fault needs its own investigation scope</h3><p>Record affected rooms, timing and what was in use without reproducing the fault or opening equipment. Distinguish a property fault from a wider supply outage. A new switchboard, extra circuit or replacement appliance should not be chosen solely because power has been lost.</p><ul class=\"intent-links\"><li><a href=\"safety-switch-tripping-perth.html\">Recurring safety-switch trips</a></li><li><a href=\"lighting-power-points-perth.html\">Faults at a light or power point</a></li><li><a href=\"lighting-installation-perth.html\">Lighting Installation &amp; Repairs Perth</a></li><li><a href=\"power-points-perth.html\">Power Point Installation &amp; Repairs Perth</a></li><li><a href=\"ceiling-fans-perth.html\">Ceiling Fan Installation &amp; Repairs Perth</a></li><li><a href=\"exhaust-fans-perth.html\">Bathroom Exhaust Fan Replacement Perth</a></li><li><a href=\"switchboard-upgrades-perth.html\">Switchboard Repairs &amp; Upgrades Perth</a></li><li><a href=\"emergency-electrician-perth.html\">24-Hour Emergency Electrician Perth</a></li></ul><details><summary>{{ppp:faq:0:question}}</summary>{{ppp:faq:0:answer}}</details><details><summary>{{ppp:faq:1:question}}</summary>{{ppp:faq:1:answer}}</details><div class=\"service-information\"><h3>{{ppp:faq:2:question}}</h3>{{ppp:faq:2:answer}}</div><div class=\"service-information\"><h3>{{ppp:faq:3:question}}</h3>{{ppp:faq:3:answer}}</div></div><!-- site-intent:end --><div class=\"service-information\"><h3>{{ppp:faq:4:question}}</h3>{{ppp:faq:4:answer}}</div>\n\n<div class=\"service-information\"><h3>{{ppp:faq:5:question}}</h3>{{ppp:faq:5:answer}}</div>\n<div class=\"service-information\"><h3>{{ppp:faq:6:question}}</h3>{{ppp:faq:6:answer}}</div>\n<div class=\"service-information\"><h3>{{ppp:faq:7:question}}</h3>{{ppp:faq:7:answer}}</div>\n<div class=\"service-information\"><h3>{{ppp:faq:8:question}}</h3>{{ppp:faq:8:answer}}</div><p class=\"related-faq-link\"><a href=\"faq.html#electrical\">Read related electrical answers</a></p></div></section>" as TrustedHtml,
