{
"question": "Intermittent electrical faults",
"answer": "<p>An intermittent fault can be investigated, although its timing may require more than one assessment stage. <a href=\"#learn-about-power-faults-perth\">Read the explanation.</a></p>" as TrustedHtml
},
{
"question": "Reporting symptoms without diagnosis",
"answer": "<p>Describe the observable change and property context. We inspect the affected area on site to establish the cause and confirm the repair scope. If more access is needed, we agree it with you first.</p>" as TrustedHtml
},
{
"question": "Power-fault enquiry details",
"answer": "<p>List the affected rooms or circuits, what happened first, what was in use and any warning signs you can observe safely.</p>" as TrustedHtml
},
{
"question": "Safety around recurring circuit trips",
"answer": "<p>Avoid repeatedly resetting an electrical device that trips again.</p>" as TrustedHtml
},
{
"question": "Burning smells and smoke",
"answer": "<p>Move to safety and call 000 if there is immediate danger.</p>" as TrustedHtml
},
{
"question": "Investigation and repair scope",
"answer": "<p>Investigation and repair can involve separate tasks. We explain the assessment scope and the proposed corrective work, including components or circuit changes, before the written quote is agreed.</p>" as TrustedHtml
}
]
},
{
"id": "service-booking",
"kind": "rich",
"html": "\n<section class=\"section contact-band service-booking\" id=\"service-booking\"><div class=\"shell service-reading\"><h2>Book electrical fault finding</h2><p>Include the suburb, affected rooms or circuits, when the interruption began and any recurrence. For a managed property, add the access contact, work-order number and approval instructions. Our local team covers <a href=\"service-areas.html\">all six Perth service regions</a> from our office at {{ppp:shared:business.addressLine:html}}.</p><p>Call to discuss the work or send the property details through our enquiry form. You do not need to diagnose the fault or complete a technical inspection before contacting us.</p><a class=\"button\" href=\"tel:{{ppp:shared:business.localTelephone:html}}\">Call {{ppp:shared:business.displayTelephone:html}}</a> <a class=\"button service-book-button\" href=\"contact.html?service=power-faults-perth.html\">Request a visit &amp; written quote</a></div></section>" as TrustedHtml
},
{
